OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,FOperation Brock, the contraflow system
OL,7,Fused on the M20 in Kent, to hold
OL,8,Florries waiting to travel through
OL,9,FDover - may no longer be needed thanks
OL,10,Fto a #20m investment.
OL,12,FKent County Council say plans to
OL,13,Freconfigure the Eastern Docks at the
OL,14,Fport will increase queuing capacity by
OL,15,Fmore than 500 HGVs.
OL,17,FIt cost taxpayers in Kent nearly
OL,18,F#500,000 to deploy and remove the
OL,19,Fcontroversial concrete barrier for
OL,20,Fjust a week in May.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
