CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,FIn that same time, highways teams had
OL,7,Fto deal with 95 incidents - according
OL,8,Fto data obtained by ITV News.
OL,10,FBut KCC says the planned improvements
OL,11,Fare expected to reduce the frequency
OL,12,Fand duration of Operation Brock and
OL,13,FDover TAP by up to 80% during normal
OL,14,Foperations.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
