OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,FDoug Bannister, CEO of the Port of
OL,7,FDover, said: "Structurally the big
OL,8,Fimprovement will be when we can re-
OL,9,Forder the controls and push the
OL,10,Fcontrols deeper into the port, and
OL,11,Fcreate a lot more processing capacity
OL,12,Fwithin in the port.
OL,14,F"That's going to be a game-changer."
OL,16,FThe scheme is expected to help keep
OL,17,Ftraffic within the Port itself,
OL,18,Freducing the impact on the A20, M20
OL,19,Fand surrounding road network.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
