OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,FKCC successfully secured #20 million
OL,7,Ffrom the Department for Transport
OL,8,F(DfT) through the Levelling Up Fund to
OL,9,Fenable the scheme to proceed,
OL,10,Falongside investment from the Port of
OL,11,FDover. T
OL,13,FKCC insists it will not be
OL,14,Fcontributing any of its own funding
OL,15,Ftowards the scheme.
OL,17,FPeter Osborne, KCC's Cabinet Member
OL,18,Ffor Highways and Transport said: "This
OL,19,Fproject represents the beginning of
OL,20,Fthe end for Operation Brock as we've
OL,21,Fcome to know it.
OL,26,@zD@bOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,F"For years, Kent residents, businesses
OL,7,Fand visitors have experienced the
OL,8,Fdisruption caused when traffic backs
OL,9,Fup around the Port of Dover.
OL,11,F"KCC has worked relentlessly with
OL,12,Fgovernment and the Port of Dover to
OL,13,Fdevelop a lasting solution, and we
OL,14,Fsuccessfully secured #20 million of
OL,15,Ffunding to make it happen.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,F"By creating more space for border
OL,7,Fprocessing capacity and vehicle
OL,8,Fqueuing within the Port, this scheme
OL,9,Fis expected to significantly cut the
OL,10,Fneed for Operation Brock and Dover TAP
OL,11,Fby up to 80% during normal operations,
OL,12,Fhelping keep traffic moving and
OL,13,Fsupporting communities across Kent.
OL,15,F"It's a significant milestone for
OL,16,FDover, for Kent and for the resilience
OL,17,Fof one of the UK's most important
OL,18,Ftrade routes."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,FBut the Conservative MP for Faversham
OL,7,Fand Mid Kent, Helen Whately said: "I
OL,8,Faccept that sometimes in an emergency,
OL,9,Fwhen something goes very very badly
OL,10,Fwrong, you may need to have something
OL,11,Flike Operation Brock for holding
OL,12,Ftraffic on the motorway.
OL,14,F"But that's what it should be - for an
OL,15,Femergency.
OL,17,F"What we see is people who can't get
OL,18,Fto appointments, they can't get to
OL,19,Fwork.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
