OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,382,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F381A1785383017
OL,3,C#20 million Port of Dover funding
OL,4,Ccould see end of Operation Brock
OL,6,F"It really affects businesses,
OL,7,Fparticularly Leeds Castle.
OL,9,F"Whenever it's on the news, and people
OL,10,Fsee Operation Brock is in force they
OL,11,Fthink 'oh well we won't go to Kent.'
OL,13,F"It's become normal when it shouldn't
OL,14,Fbe."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
